<title>UK: Bayer Hypo sets 3.0 bln Ffr 6-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo sets 3.0 bln Ffr 6-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Credit Commercial de France and Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.875     MATURITY    10.OCT.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.95    PAY DATE    10.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.40     SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+  DENOMS (K) 10-100-1,000 SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 2001 AND 2002 OAT</p>
